= Burton Kendall Wheeler

Burton K. Wheeler [? if spd_prussia = 1 : is ?][? if spd_prussia = 0 : was ?] a senator from Montana, and thus the only person in our party in any federal institution. Well-known for his 1922 vice-presidential candidacy for the Progressive Party. 

